# Personal project instructions (template)

Copy this file to `CLAUDE.local.md` at the repository root. It is gitignored, loads alongside
`CLAUDE.md`, and is read last — so it is the right place for anything machine-specific or personal
that should not go into the shared, reviewable configuration.

Keep it short. It costs context in every session exactly like `CLAUDE.md` does.

Delete the headings you do not use.

